{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id27740754"}, "name":{"label":"Whitelock"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-05-27T12:22:02-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"1626016323"}, "title":{"label":"Pretty flawless - get it now!"}, "content":{"label":"I have previously relied on Apple's stock Reminders and Notes apps, and when I saw the reviews and read the developer's website about how much effort and attention went into Things 3, I gave it a punt.\n\nIt's an amazingly well designed app, with a lot of time and attention to the smallest details. Beautifully designed, flawlessly smooth and very well put together. It's now my go-to reminders and to-do app. Well worth the price - you won't regret it!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
