{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id19905869"}, "name":{"label":"JRY2099"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-05-27T04:15:47-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"1625647279"}, "title":{"label":"Great update - very slick and frictionless"}, "content":{"label":"I rarely leave reviews, but feel this app deserves one. And a glowing one at that. Really intuitive design enabling you to capture your thoughts and processing them into steps you can take each day to get things done. I upgraded from version 1 to this and had no issues - all of my existing info migrated across without incident. If you have a lot on and need to get organised, this app is a great tool to have.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id176487522"}, "name":{"label":"MetaD"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-05-27T00:35:27-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"1625466877"}, "title":{"label":"Functional"}, "content":{"label":"Works very well. I've been using a slightly more feature packed alternative on Mac and iOS. However this is faster and smarter. So made the switch and bought both. Like that they have their independent  server, which syncs rapidly. Don't think there battery life has taken a hit on iPhone 6, so happy there too (since I use it more than the other programme). The three standout features are the areas feature - I have many 'areas' that I can throw ideas into now. The drag and drop is key in a busy day. Last the swipe to select is also highly intuitive. Animations and other rapid use features are key.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id148531164"}, "name":{"label":"ClumsyHunterX"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-05-26T09:03:42-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"1624922733"}, "title":{"label":"Absolutely amazing"}, "content":{"label":"The app is so easy to understand. As so often with to-do app. They can either be too complex or too simple. This app is complex but it had been smartly designed that it is so easy to learn and use.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
