{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id12942256"}, "name":{"label":"Tommy Goodbeer"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-05-26T08:10:48-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"1624886708"}, "title":{"label":"Pretty nice"}, "content":{"label":"This is certainly a great app like many reviews say, however it could be even more awesome and intuitive especially with the pricetag. There could be a sort of matrix view where you can just manually move things into different days or times from one screen view by dropping them in. It would also be more useful to have photos and voice recordings attachable to a note or to-do item.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id8996984"}, "name":{"label":"InkyBrush"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-05-26T06:40:54-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"1624824785"}, "title":{"label":"Really Useful"}, "content":{"label":"I find this app very flexible and useable. I have used Wunderlist and tried to like it but in my experience it was so-so. I get along real well with Things. I'm glad to have all my sheets of to-do lists melded to one flexible digital list. No complaints, just happy. Many thanks to Cultured Code.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id152703511"}, "name":{"label":"BarbarianAtTheGate"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-05-26T06:10:58-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"1624803710"}, "title":{"label":"A Good Start"}, "content":{"label":"It took me a while to take the plunge as it's not cheap to get the full set for iPad, iPhone and Mac. But so far I'm impressed. It's replaced my other go-to task manager and I found ways not to lose any functionality in the move (apart from emailing to a list). \n\nBut where Things 3 shines is the quality of the interface. It's clean and easy to work out what to do. It's set a new standard in ToDo look and feel plus function (and I've used a few!).", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id201805864"}, "name":{"label":"Mostin1981"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-05-26T03:59:20-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"1624705568"}, "title":{"label":"Beautiful new version"}, "content":{"label":"It's taken a while, but this new version of Things is just great. I was on the brink of moving to another to do app, but glad I didn't. Things 3 will help you organise pretty much anything in your life, in a simple, elegant way. Bravo. One tiny thing - could you add iOS functionality to apply a to-do to a person?", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id28168215"}, "name":{"label":"Wattsie2011"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-05-26T02:24:59-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"1624631359"}, "title":{"label":"Upgraded"}, "content":{"label":"Despite being called an update I think that this is like a new product. I am loving it so far.  Intuitive controls make it simple to use and the new features address many of the things that I used to find repetitive in Things 2. \n\nIt was expensive to buy three versions, iPad, iPhone and Mac but so far I think I will get a return on the investment.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id404766027"}, "name":{"label":"Asdyiohbjknej"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-05-26T01:36:48-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"1624589989"}, "title":{"label":"Amazing app - 3 suggestions"}, "content":{"label":"This is an amazing app and I'm definitely switching over from Todoist. I have three suggestions that would make it honestly perfect. \n\n1) night mode - just to make it easier on the eyes when viewing the app in the dark\n2) easier to toggle and wider variety of natural language selection (I had to look for it and had to read the manual)\n3) recurring tasks within projects", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
