{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id14443955"}, "name":{"label":"ageerev"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-05-25T12:01:51-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"1624076046"}, "title":{"label":"Love it :)"}, "content":{"label":"Lovely app. Majorly simplified my workflow. Beautiful UI and experience. \n\nPlease can we have the ability to add tags to multiple tasks at once on iOS? Would be super helpful\n\nThanks to the great team", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id34094543"}, "name":{"label":"Mthorbes"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-05-25T09:51:38-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"1624020371"}, "title":{"label":"Fantastic"}, "content":{"label":"This has fixed all the little irritations with Things 2 and brought in a few new features that really make it a simple and efficient to do tool. \n\nIt's hard to describe to someone why this is so much better than the simple apple Reminders app. But it is. \n\nIf you use to do lists a lot, it's well worth getting the iPhone version, and if you really like it, expanding out to the iPad and Mac versions.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
