{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id85210988"}, "name":{"label":"Jonny Back"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-05-25T00:36:11-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"1623614582"}, "title":{"label":"Solid new update"}, "content":{"label":"Great to-do app. No subscriptions. Great sync and lots of customisation to sort various lists", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id24590770"}, "name":{"label":"Rylstone"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-05-25T00:35:04-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"1623613674"}, "title":{"label":"Better than previous version"}, "content":{"label":"I really do think these prompts to rate apps are way to quick, I've only been using the app on my iPhone for a few days. \nNegative points:\n- If I go for the app on all my devices, it will cost upward to £100, 2 macs, 1 iPhone & 1 iPad. \n- You can't use it on iOS below iOS 10, that rules out my trusted iPad, I use this device a lot. \n- I will update my iPad to a Pro, I'm waiting to see if there's an update to the Pro soon, by then the 20% discount will have ceased.\nI haven't found yet if you can add images, drawings, sketches etc to a project. \nPositives\n- The projects area is good, easy to add, alter and colse off. \n- Overall so much better than the older version. \nSummary \nToo expensive if you run many devices. \nNot backward compatible on old operating systems. \nDiscount period is way too short and not aimed at long time supportive users. \nIs by far better than previous version.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
