{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id102577092"}, "name":{"label":"Mr Tom Willmot"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-05-24T11:25:19-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"1623137758"}, "title":{"label":"Beautifully formed but lacking collaboration"}, "content":{"label":"Things oozes attention to detail and is beautifully designed at all levels. From the basics of entry and organisation through to the many small flourishes and thoughtful interactions. \n\nIt's a solitary affair though, if you want to share todos with others, you're Ot of luck.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id20925456"}, "name":{"label":"Mr PWD"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-05-24T11:14:36-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"1623133727"}, "title":{"label":"Life choice."}, "content":{"label":"I've been using Things 1 & 2 since conception and it has improved my productivity dramatically, especially in times of stress. Just push the items you can leave 'till later off the page and hey presto, there it is. Buy it.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id107331477"}, "name":{"label":"Pabbiel"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-05-24T09:59:22-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"1623103215"}, "title":{"label":"Brilliant!"}, "content":{"label":"I used things everyday and really helpful but things 3 is a whole new experience. This sounds mad but it's like my brain, it helps me organise my life and I can even have lists of lists. Also brought for my Mac. I just love ❤️ it and worth every penny. Thank you", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id173577108"}, "name":{"label":"ajpabc"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-05-24T08:22:05-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"1623051049"}, "title":{"label":"Sooo Good!"}, "content":{"label":"I've made the switch back after leaving things 2 a couple of years ago. I had been using another app which was way too complicated for general life. The beauty of this app lays in its simplicity and effectiveness.  It also looks sooo good!  You want to get things done just to use the app and then tick them off!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
