{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id277068535"}, "name":{"label":"Lemondixon"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-05-23T13:55:05-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"1622265450"}, "title":{"label":"Brilliant But Still No Email Support"}, "content":{"label":"Really like the new version (both Things 3 for Mac and iOS) and don't even begrudge paying 80% of my original purchase price all over again for BOTH apps (well maybe I do a bit and the discount for us loyal customers could of been higher, but that's life)\nHOWEVER what has upset me a bit is that for a 'complete new design' of the iOS App it STILL doesn't have any way to create New To-Do's from within the email app!!! (Correct me if I'm wrong?) This always route was an option on the Mac version and is a HUGE part of most people's workflow, so to have it missing still after paying another £7.99 for the App (plus £38.99 for the Mac App) is a bit of an own goal. Tech support did tell me long time ago this was Apple being difficult so kinda understand, but really ought to be a useable workaround by now. So if Tech Support at reading these reviews ...\nStill got a LOT OF LOVE for Things 3 though, and is the BEST out there by a huge margin.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
